On Jan 12, 4:06=A0am, Johnny Billquist <b...@softjar.se> wrote:
> However, if you wanted Ethernet on your DEC-20, I think the NIA-20 was
> the only way. The PDP-11 FEs couldn't handle ethernet for you, could they=
