Is there a disk controller for a PDP 8/E that will interface to a
RL02?

EK-RL012-UG-005 indicates that there are 4 controllers that can be
used with an RL02. For a PDP 8, the only one mentioned is a RL8A
(M8433) that can talk to any combination of RL01/RL02s.  The M8433 is
a hex-height card (would work in an 8/A), so it won't fit into the 8/
E, which is quad-height.

I seem to remember going down this road many many years ago and the
answer was that there is no quad-height controller for RL02s.

Can someone confirm this?
Thanks

John


