the Feb 1993 catalogue has the prices printed in (they started getting
very volatile). So here's what I have, hope it helps.

VAXstation 4000 VLC from =A35588 (8MB, 19" mono monitor)
VAXstation 4000/60 from =A39466 (16MB, 19" greyscale monitor)
VAXstation 4000/90 from =A313530 (16MB, 19" greyscale monitor)

