remember reading it was not part of the original design goals but
since the protocol was publicly available, it was rolled into the
Linux version.  Early versions may have been less robust than later
versions.  I used the version in Ubuntu 8.04 LTS and did not see the
problems cited in this thread...then again, my use of it was minimal.

